    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your companion has transcended beasthood. Although they're still your faithful friend, they're also a vessel for nature's wisdom and memories. Your companion's Reason score [[/apply X3LD0QCUiHRjKNR3]]{increases to 1}, or [[/apply 4WaVBWewxvzXHMG4]]{increases by 1} if it is already 1 or higher, and they learn every language you know. Your companion can communicate telepathically with any creature within 10 squares, using language as well as images and feelings. Additionally, you learn the Nature skill and one other skill from the lore skill group.</p>",
